  - Server navigation: fixed the roll field (shm_r) displayed above
  360 degrees in the HUD (spacegl_hud.c main page and shared-memory
  inspector, and the OpenGL 3D view readout) after a "pos <H> <M> [R]"
  command. Two paths could leave van_r outside [0, 360): (a) handle_pos
